<title>UK: ATHLETICS-WORLD CROSS-COUNTRY CHALLENGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CROSS-COUNTRY CHALLENGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DURHAM, England 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the second</p>
<p>round of the World Challenge cross-country series on Saturday:</p>
<p>Women's 5.2 km</p>
<p> 1. Geta Wami (Ethiopia)	  17 minutes 32 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Elena Fidatof (Romania)     17:33</p>
<p> 3. Paula Radcliffe (Britain)   17:38</p>
<p> 4. Lucy Elliott (Britain)	18:00</p>
<p> 5. Mariana Chirila (Romania)   18:00</p>
<p>Men's 9.3-km</p>
<p> 1. Jon Brown (Britain)		 28 minutes 24 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Daniel Komen (Kenya)		28:27</p>
<p> 3. Hendrick Ramaala (South Africa) 28:31</p>
<p> 4. Yan Millon (France)		 28:39</p>
<p> 5. Andrew Pearson (Britain)	  28:46</p>
